      "text": "Reset Token Controller\nResend OTP\nDelete User Controller\nAuth Middleware — Must\nAnd Day After Tomorrow’s User\nController tasks:\nGet Me\nGet User profile\nUpdate User Details\nUpdate User Profile\nChange Password\n\n\ndeleteUser\n\ngetAllUsers (admin)\n\ndeactivateUser (for bans/suspensions)",
